1/72)","image_url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/vZCIr1zL7RU6sq0QsSluP3Z28ehjFa8Yz3dFbhvWm4Kb_maDNrRFKWYkOLW-YTr1_HBSsXtwmVSeMu9iyz7Z","description":"Radnice v Praze byla založena roku 1338 na základě privilegia uděleného staroměstským měšťanům králem Janem Lucemburským. Tvoří ji komplex několika domů přiléhajících ke Staroměstskému náměstí.","author_name":null,"author_faction":null,"type":"sequential","has_details":true,"first_seen_at":"2026-05-17T03:22:49.128Z","last_seen_at":"2026-05-17T03:22:49.128Z","updated_at":"2026-11-17T22:37:14.547Z"},"distance_m":45.5},{"mission":{"guid":"dc1608f193044b86b991e4277d675634.1c","title":"#MP REDACTED 22 Prague, Czech Republic","image_url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/B1AsDO5mUgGg8gklVUTpFP1iFAGCQHZN5r3vCfmZgdum1tIpQWofinBl1NG5Op-OPkarDdglYis3VRFK2HdO","description":"Global XFAC REDACTED Project. While walking the streets of Prague, capture, resonate and link portals for the last time in the Redacted Scanner.","author_name":null,"author_faction":null,"type":"sequential","has_details":true,"first_seen_at":"2022-12-27T09:37:28.203Z","last_seen_at":"2022-12-27T09:37:28.203Z","updated_at":"2026-11-18T01:49:05.662Z"},"distance_m":45.5},{"mission":{"guid":"33e381efef184244b56e8c650539416d.1c","title":"MD: Prague, Old Town Square","image_url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/Jbz4dd-Ba0SP5CvQoCtXl0TO6GemRNXbwIuYSO1UmD7xfxKzxNA82xhqcMEDJCF-IMkC8kq8w0o80zZfpWe3QA","description":"Old Town Square is a historic square in the Old Town quarter of Prague, the capital of the Czech Republic. It is located between Wenceslas Square and the Charles Bridge.","author_name":null,"author_faction":null,"type":"any_order","has_details":true,"first_seen_at":"2026-05-17T01:16:32.142Z","last_seen_at":"2026-05-17T01:16:32.142Z","updated_at":"2026-11-18T02:18:16.356Z"},"distance_m":45.5},{"mission":{"guid":"23c08a852359408baa09bd81885f0606.1c","title":"Česká republika 14","image_url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/X5dZlsdLjI5805xJHbmyq1PLX76